ind":"announcement","title":"Live now: Dynamic Breach, the full game","summary":"Dynamic Breach is live on this page. The developer is playing the full game ahead of the November 2 launch: campaign missions, the Onslaught horde mode and versus matches against bots. No voice commentary, just the game. The free demo is available right now on this page, with the whole Prologue and the Breach mode. If you like what you see, add Dynamic Breach to your wishlist to be notified on launch day.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T21:10:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042999","verified_at":"2026-10-25T22:10:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5005570-1847286114030638","game_id":"steam-5005570","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you, and what comes next: seasons included in the game","summary":"Hello everyone, Since the demo came out, more and more of you have been following Dynamic Breach, playing it and writing to me. I make this game alone, and every wishlist counts: thank you. What comes next: seasons, included in the game Requiem, the campaign that releases on November 2, is complete: 33 operations, with endings that depend on your choices. But it is only the beginning. I am already working on Season 2, and I am aiming for five or six seasons in total, each with its own campaign a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:53:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030638","verified_at":"2026-10-22T01:32:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5005570-1846651706692734","game_id":"steam-5005570","kind":"announcement","title":"In Steam Next Fest until October 26","summary":"Dynamic Breach is in Steam Next Fest, from October 19 to October 26. The demo is free on the store page for the whole festival: a top-down tactical shooter, gothic-military and necro-technological, in which you command a squad of AI allies, and every mode can be played solo, offline, against bots. You have a lot of demos to get through, so here is the short version. The campaign, Requiem, is 33 operations across 6 acts, each on a purpose-built map, with cutscenes and endings that change with you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692734","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5005570-1845383656396611","game_id":"steam-5005570","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is available now","summary":"The Dynamic Breach demo is on the store page now, free. It covers the five operations of the prologue and the Breach versus mode against bots. Dynamic Breach is a top-down tactical shooter, gothic-military and necro-technological: you command a squad of AI allies, and every mode can be played solo, offline, against bots. The full game releases on November 2, 2026. What the full game holds Requiem: a solo campaign of 33 operations across 6 acts, a purpose-built map for each, with cutscenes and en","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T14:20:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396611","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5005570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5005570":"2026-10-26T07:13:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5005570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:3